Owner decision and date:
`docs/POLISH_PLAN.md` sections 6.2 (row 1), 6.3, 6.4, and 7 batch 5 (applied 2026-11-13).

Upstream status:
Not sent, because whether upstream `Smithay/smithay` already removed these five imports on `master` was not confirmed from this worktree (`docs/POLISH_PLAN.md` section 6.2 row 1); ready to send upstream if still present.

